# Kestrel Strand (CIPlay vi_kestrel_strand; VI1 vehicle island): quest "Mayday", the six steps in order
island Kestrel Strand
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Mayday
expect hidden stash
zone crash
expect step 1
read Pilot's logbook
expect step 2
kill Hyena
